SUMMARY:a reading of ‘pointy toothed god’ by Eleanor Lepp
ORGANIZATION:Shepherd University
LOCATION:Shepherd Univ - Studio 112, 92 West Campus Drive, Shepherdstown
DESCRIPTION:<p>Lecture / Discussion / Book Talk\nrn\nJoin us for a reading of ‘pointy toothed god’ next Thursday\, April 30\, at 7:30pm in studio 112\, Shepherd University!\nrn\nrn\nrn\n(content warning!! strong language and themes of death. but still a hopeful story!)\nrn\nrn\nrn\n(not suggested for the kiddos)\nrn\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherd Univ - Studio 112\, 92 West Campus Drive\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US</p
CATEGORIES:Music & Film & Stage
STATUS:CONFIRMED
