SUMMARY:"Shepherdstown Live" First Friday Music
ORGANIZATION:Town of Shepherdstown
LOCATION:McMurran Hall Lawn Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:<p>Enjoy free live outdoor music on First Fridays in May-October on the lawn of McMurran Hall\, in downtown Shepherdstown. Bring your friends/family\, a chair or blanket\, and stay after the music to dine\, shop and play! Today's band OPHSET -a dynamic six-piece band bringing together the best of Pop\, Rock\, R&B\, Hip Hop\, and Country\, with a special love for the sounds of the 2000s through today\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> McMurran Hall Lawn Outdoors\, 102 S. King St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Shannon Thomas 6513297063 shanpur@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Community & Civic, Music & Film & Stage
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
