SUMMARY:Full Moon Sound Healing
ORGANIZATION:Mohalu Wellness
LOCATION:Mohalu Wellness
DESCRIPTION:<p>Each month we honor the full moon through a sound healing and meditation practice designed to focus in on our connection the lunar cycle. Sound healings support emotional\, physical and mental well-being through sound and vibrations created with crystal bowls tuned to the frequency of each chakra. Sound healing reduces anxiety and blood pressure\, while promoting healthier sleep.\nAttendees are encouraged to wear comfy clothes and a bottle of water for this restorative practice.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Mohalu Wellness\, 126 W. German St.\, Shepherdstown\, WV\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Lona Lozinski info@mohaluwellness.com </p
CATEGORIES:Uncategorized
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?share=697693a2a24a7
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
