SUMMARY:Annual Garden Club Plant Sale
ORGANIZATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
LOCATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
DESCRIPTION:<p>Potomac-Meckenburg Garden Club’s annual plant sale\, featuring perennials and shrubs from member’s gardens plus colorful annuals and hanging baskets. Proceeds support the club’s scholarship fund and community projects. Come early for best selection!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Trinity Episcopal Church\, W German St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Esther Murphy 7039803928 esther_murphy@comcast.net</p
