SUMMARY:Guns to Gardens - unused/unwanted firearm trade-in for gift cards
ORGANIZATION:Shepherdstown Fire Department
LOCATION:Shepherdstown Fire Hall
DESCRIPTION:<p>Activity\nSponsored by Shepherdstown Presbyterian Church\nGUNS TO GARDENS\nA Safe Gun Disposal Event\nUnwanted Firearms Are Made into Garden Tools\nPlease Bring Unwanted Firearms to\nShepherdstown Fire Department\n8052 Martinsburg Pike\, Shepherdstown\, WV\nSaturday\, May 2\, 2026\, 1 – 3:30 pm\nGuns are carefully dismantled on site\nGuns must be:\n• Unloaded\n• Stored in car trunk or back end of vehicle\n• In working order\nYou will receive thank you gift cards to local grocery stores:\n• $50 per handgun\n• $100 per rifle/shotgun\n• $200 per semiautomatic\nFor Further Information:\n(571) 577-9211\nguns2gardens@shepherdstownpresbyterian.org\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherdstown Fire Hall\, 8052 Martinsburg Pike\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Leslie Williams (571) 577-9211 guns2gardens@shepherdstownpresbyterian.org</p
CATEGORIES:Outdoors & Nature
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
