SUMMARY:Historic Shepherdstown Speaker Series - "Main Street: A Proven Strategy for Small Historic Towns"
ORGANIZATION:Shepherd University
LOCATION:Shepherd Univ - Byrd Center for Congressional History and Education
DESCRIPTION:<p>Erin Barnes\, President and CEO of Main Street America (a subsidiary of the National Trust for Historic Preservation) will address the success of the Main Street movement over the past 45 years in demonstrating the effectiveness of a combination of historic preservation\, economic development\, marketing and business development strategies in strengthening the competitiveness of the downtowns of historic small towns.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherd Univ - Byrd Center for Congressional History and Education\, 213 North King Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Suprena Mills 304-876-0910 hsc1786@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Community & Civic, History
URL:https://historicshepherdstown.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
