SUMMARY:Woven: An Appalachian Tapestry
ORGANIZATION:Shepherdstown Presbyterian Church
LOCATION:Shepherdstown Presbyterian Church
DESCRIPTION:<p>Countless threads composed of diverse stories\, sounds\, and voices weave together to create the traditions of Appalachian music. Join Renatum as we explore the musical fiber of America's backbone.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherdstown Presbyterian Church\, 100 W. Washington St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Lauren Frick 7173602636 renatumchoir@gmail.com</p
