SUMMARY:FREE YOGA: Flow with Pride
ORGANIZATION:Mohalu Wellness
LOCATION:Shepherd Univ - McMurran Hall
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us as we celebrate Pride!\nThe month of June is Pride Month\, a chance to celebrate our LGBTQ+ community\, highlight their contributions and support their access to civic rights.\nThis is a FREE yoga offering on the lawn of McMurran Hall immediately following the Shepherdstown Pride Parade. Come as you are\, mats will be provided. No registration required. Rain location will be the Mohalu Wellness studio on German St\, just down the block from McMurran.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherd Univ - McMurran Hall\, 101 E German St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Lona Lozinski info@mohaluwellness.com </p
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?share=69da33548e6a3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
